'' TKO0808: a qualified name whose qualifier path fails is not declared. It used to fall back
'' to the UNqualified name and bind whatever was in scope -- a forward Foo, a real Bar -- so
'' 'type Q as NS.Foo' and 'dim as NS.Foo' compiled -- with NS declared, only its member
'' missing. fbc refuses exactly lines 9 and 10 of the source (errors 3 and 14).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/qualified-no-fallback.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: qualified-no-fallback.bas(9,11): error TKO0808
'' EXPECT-OUT: the type 'ns.foo' is not declared
'' EXPECT-OUT: qualified-no-fallback.bas(10,8): error TKO0808
'' EXPECT-OUT: the type 'ns.foo' is not declared
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 2
